    "summary": "The user expresses intense guilt and moral inadequacy regarding a past incident, eventually suggesting that the world might be better if they were dead. The assistant responds by validating the user's pain and the heaviness of their feelings while consistently directing them toward professional mental health support and crisis resources.",
